      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11480990::web::073::feature_interpretation"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Greater atomic-size mismatch disrupts the regular atomic packing needed for crystalline-phase nucleation and growth.",
