      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11480990::web::073::feature_interpretation"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Increased melt viscosity impedes the atomic diffusion and rearrangement required for crystal growth.",
